  "description": "Kang Geon-Ma, a man who made Busan kneel down on him at the mere age of 18 years old. Something appeared that made his dry heart completely on fire, that is ‘Hip-hop’! How to make Seoul united in order to become a rapper! The man Kang Geon-Ma! Today, he is beating people again to become a rapper! For your reference, both of the authors don’t know a thing about what is rapping exactly is!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: The chapter count includes an epilogue.*",
